# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 041C:0159"
msgid "You are unworthy to remain here. Die, fool! "
msgstr "你不配留在這裡。去死吧，蠢貨！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 041C:01AF"
msgid "Don't touch that. "
msgstr "別碰那個。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 041C:020E"
msgid "While you are here, you will leave my things be. "
msgstr "你在這裡的時候，不准碰我的東西。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 041C:026B"
msgid "I warn you. I will kill you for this behavior. "
msgstr "我警告你。你再這樣，我就殺了你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 13 (justMoved)
msgctxt "bark 041C:02A1"
msgid "You will die... now! "
msgstr "你死定了……就是現在！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:031B"
msgid "Vardion the dead Sorcerer "
msgstr "死去的巫師瓦爾迪恩"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:0349"
msgid "Vardion the Sorcerer "
msgstr "巫師瓦爾迪恩"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:038A"
msgid "the deceased Vardion "
msgstr "已故的瓦爾迪恩"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:03AA"
msgid "Vardion"
msgstr "瓦爾迪恩"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:03E4"
msgid "dead Sorcerer "
msgstr "死去的巫師"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:0406"
msgid "Sorcerer "
msgstr "巫師"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:0435"
msgid "dead mage "
msgstr "死去的法師"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 041C:0453"
msgid "mage "
msgstr "法師"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Tell me of this place. "
msgstr "說說這個地方。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Who are you? "
msgstr "你是誰？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What do you do? "
msgstr "你是做什麼的？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Yes, I am prepared. "
msgstr "是的，我準備好了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Let me think on it more. "
msgstr "讓我再考慮一下。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I won't do your dirty work! "
msgstr "我才不替你幹骯髒事！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Farewell. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Farewell. "
msgstr "再會。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Farewell. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:08B5"
msgid "Are you finished? "
msgstr "說完了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me of this place. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0A01"
msgid "How can it be that you do not know of the Sorcerer's Enclave? "
msgstr "你怎麼會不知道巫師聚落？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me of this place. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I am a stranger here. "
msgstr "我是外地人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me of this place. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I know. I'm just asking you. "
msgstr "我知道。我只是問問你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me of this place. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Just answer my question. "
msgstr "回答我的問題就是了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Just answer my question. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0AC7"
msgid "What?! How dare you! "
msgstr "什麼？！你好大的膽子！"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I know. I'm just asking you. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0B4A"
msgid "Fine then, you've no need to ask me your tiresome questions. "
msgstr "那好，你也用不著問我這些煩人的問題了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0C06"
msgid "You are a stranger indeed, but regardless, I will tell you because you need to be aware of the danger you are in while here. "
msgstr "你的確是外地人，不過我還是會告訴你，因為你得知道你在這裡有多危險。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "First Acolyte. What is that? "
msgstr "第一學徒？那是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0DBC"
msgid "This is the Sorcerer's Enclave. As First Acolyte, it is my duty to make sure that the Sorcerers learn about the Fire and keep the old ways alive. "
msgstr "這裡是巫師聚落。身為第一學徒，我的職責是確保巫師們學習火焰之道，並讓古老的傳統延續下去。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0DBC"
msgid "This is the Sorcerer's Enclave. We Sorcerers gather here to learn about the Fire and keep the old ways alive. "
msgstr "這裡是巫師聚落。我們巫師聚集在此，學習火焰之道，並讓古老的傳統延續下去。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Tell me about Sorcerers. "
msgstr "說說巫師。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Tell me of the Fire. "
msgstr "說說火焰。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I am a stranger here. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Old ways? "
msgstr "古老的傳統？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? " or "What do you do? "
msgctxt "bark 041C:0ED9"
msgid "I am Vardion, First Acolyte of Sorcerer's Enclave. Keep this in mind, and we'll have no strife. "
msgstr "我是瓦爾迪恩，巫師聚落的第一學徒。記住這一點，我們就不會有衝突。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who are you? " or "What do you do? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What is an Acolyte? "
msgstr "學徒是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerers. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:102D"
msgid "Sorcerers are practitioners of the element of Fire. We are not to be trifled with. "
msgstr "巫師是修習火元素的人。我們可不是好惹的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerers. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What is an element? "
msgstr "元素是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me about Sorcerers. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Must you treat me like a child? "
msgstr "你非得把我當小孩嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Tell me of the Fire. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1180"
msgid "Fire is all consuming. It lives within the mountain, and burns within your own body. It is the element I give my life to study. "
msgstr "火焰吞噬一切。它活在山中，也在你的身體裡燃燒。這是我奉獻一生研究的元素。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Old ways? "
msgctxt "bark 041C:125E"
msgid "The old ways are the rituals and ceremonies that we use to bind the Lord of Flame to our wills. "
msgstr "古老的傳統，就是我們用來把烈焰之主束縛於我們意志之下的儀式與典禮。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Old ways? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What rituals and ceremonies? "
msgstr "什麼儀式與典禮？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Old ways? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Who is the Lord of Flame? "
msgstr "烈焰之主是誰？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an Acolyte? "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1353"
msgid "Acolytes are chosen from amongst the Disciples to assist the Master in the old ways. "
msgstr "學徒是從門徒中挑選出來，協助大師舉行古老儀式的人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an Acolyte? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What is a Disciple? "
msgstr "門徒是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an Acolyte? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Who or what is the Master? "
msgstr "大師是誰，或者說是什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an Acolyte? "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1425"
msgid "One is chosen from their number to become the First Acolyte. I have that honor and duty. "
msgstr "從他們之中再選出一人成為第一學徒。我就肩負這份榮耀與職責。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "First Acolyte. What is that? "
msgctxt "bark 041C:154C"
msgid "It is a position of respect amonst my kind. I handle the affairs of the Enclave, and our dealings with Tenebrae. This gives the Master more time to commit to his research and spellcraft. "
msgstr "那是我們同類之間受人尊敬的地位。我處理聚落的事務，以及我們與泰尼伯瑞的往來。這讓大師有更多時間投入他的研究與施法技藝。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "First Acolyte. What is that? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "You have dealings with Tenebrae? "
msgstr "你們跟泰尼伯瑞有往來？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "First Acolyte. What is that? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What does the Master research? "
msgstr "大師在研究什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "First Acolyte. What is that? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Spellcraft? Tell me more of this. "
msgstr "施法技藝？多說一點。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an element? "
msgctxt "bark 041C:16B5"
msgid "What do you mean 'What is an element?' Where do you come from that you could possibly be so ignorant? "
msgstr "你說「元素是什麼」是什麼意思？你是從哪裡來的，怎麼會無知到這種地步？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an element? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "You don't want to know. "
msgstr "你不會想知道的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an element? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Far away. "
msgstr "很遠的地方。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an element? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "The other side of the island. "
msgstr "島的另一邊。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an element? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I sailed from another island. "
msgstr "我從另一座島航行過來。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "What is an element? "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I come from another world. "
msgstr "我來自另一個世界。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You don't want to know. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:17BD"
msgid "Yes, actually I do. "
msgstr "不，其實我想知道。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "You don't want to know. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I cannot tell you. "
msgstr "我不能告訴你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:189D"
msgid "I will respect your privacy, however, I might also ask you to respect mine when you question me. "
msgstr "我會尊重你的隱私，不過你問我問題時，我也可能會要求你尊重我的隱私。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "I still cannot tell you. "
msgstr "我還是不能告訴你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I still cannot tell you. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1948"
msgid "Fine then, but I will remember this. "
msgstr "好吧，但我會記住這件事。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Far away. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:199E"
msgid "That I can believe. Go on. "
msgstr "這我相信。說下去。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "The other side of the island. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1A30"
msgid "The other side of the island is inhospitable, stranger. "
msgstr "島的另一邊可是荒涼不毛之地，陌生人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "The other side of the island. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1A64"
msgid "Do not lie to me again. "
msgstr "別再對我說謊。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "The other side of the island. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1AB9"
msgid "How am I to trust you if you keep attempting to deceive me. "
msgstr "你老是想騙我，叫我怎麼信任你？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I sailed from another island. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1B76"
msgid "That is quite unlikely. No one has sailed here for several generations. "
msgstr "那不太可能。好幾代以來都沒人航行到這裡了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I sailed from another island. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1BAA"
msgid "Do not lie to me again. "
msgstr "別再對我說謊。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I sailed from another island. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1BFF"
msgid "How am I to trust you if you keep attempting to deceive me. "
msgstr "你老是想騙我，叫我怎麼信任你？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1D8D"
msgid "By the Guardian! I've found a world traveler. "
msgstr "守護者在上！我竟遇上了一位穿越世界的旅人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1D8D"
msgid "Although you are not completely honest, I do believe you. It would appear that I've found a world traveler. "
msgstr "雖然你並不完全誠實，但這次我相信你。看來我遇上了一位穿越世界的旅人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1D8D"
msgid "I really don't know whether or not to believe you. But if what you say is true, it would seem that I've found a world traveler. "
msgstr "我真不知道該不該相信你。不過如果你說的是真的，那我似乎遇上了一位穿越世界的旅人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1D8D"
msgid "I've found a world traveler. "
msgstr "我遇上了一位穿越世界的旅人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "bark 041C:1E14"
msgid "My grandmother always said that there were other worlds out there. It's a shame she couldn't be here to see proof. "
msgstr "我祖母總說外面還有其他世界。可惜她不在這裡，看不到證據。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Did she die? "
msgstr "她死了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "What happened to her? "
msgstr "她怎麼了？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Where is she now? "
msgstr "她現在在哪裡？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "I come from another world. "
msgctxt "ask 041C"
msgid "Who was your grandmother? "
msgstr "你祖母是誰？"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who was your grandmother? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 041C:2096"
msgid "No.  She just vanished one day.  No one knows where she is.  Her name was Mordra. She was a powerful mage, maybe she found the way to leave this world, perhaps she went to yours,  {name}."
msgstr "不。她有一天就這麼消失了，沒人知道她在哪裡。她叫莫德拉，是個強大的法師。也許她找到了離開這個世界的方法，說不定還去了你的世界，{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Who was your grandmother? "
